---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <div class="about-header">
    <img
      src="Photo.jpeg"
      alt="Portrait of Andrei Cuprinsu"
      class="profile-photo"
      width="384"
      height="512"
    />
    <div class="about-intro">
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p>
        I'm Andrei — a gameplay and engine programmer with four years of game
        development training in the <a href="https://www.buas.nl/en/programmes/creative-media-and-game-technologies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Creative Media and Game Technology</a> profile at
        <a href="https://www.buas.nl/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Breda University of Applied Sciences</a>, ranging from writing a custom C++
        engine from scratch or customizing engine templates (simplified bare-bones
        engines with only resource management and rendering), to building gameplay
        systems and tools in Unreal Engine 5, to the CI/CD and profiling tooling
        that keeps a studio shipping.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    I have a personal interest in optimization and CI/CD tooling, but I also
    enjoy building gameplay systems end-to-end — from mechanics prototyping
    through to shipped, playable builds. I do love to challenge myself with something new now and then, like building an android app just for testing some features available on android or just making a simple project to run on something random like my Samsung Smart TV.
  </p>
  <p>
    For my hobies I like to read books and novels, play video games either single player or multiplayer with my friends (Incremental/Survival/Idle/Strategy), learn some new things like a different API or some handy work like soldering circuits (haven't done that in a long while though) or making random bots for discord or other platforms and in general small scope projects 
  </p>

  <h2>Academic History</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Creative Media and Game Technology (Programming)</strong> —
      <a href="https://www.buas.nl/en/programmes/creative-media-and-game-technologies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Breda University of Applied Sciences</a>,
      2022–2026
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>C++</strong> — 5+ years of experience</li>
    <li><strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong> — C++ & Blueprints</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Engine Development</strong> — resource management, particle systems, editor/debug tooling (ImGui)</li>
    <li><strong>Dynamic Scripting</strong> — Lua integration for runtime-scriptable behavior</li>
    <li><strong>Gameplay Systems</strong> — GAS, AI/EQS, multiplayer replication</li>
    <li><strong>Multiplayer / Networking / Replication</strong> — currently building depth here (EOS, replication fundamentals), still learning</li>
    <li><strong>CI/CD & Infrastructure</strong> — Jenkins, Perforce (incl. server administration), Git, NetBird VPN, automated profiling</li>
    <li><strong>Platform Integration</strong> — Steam SDK, Steam Deck, cross-platform builds</li>
    <li><strong>Reinforcement Learning</strong> — DQN agents, PyTorch, custom training environments</li>
    <li><strong>Applied Graphics Math</strong> — ray tracing, mesh boolean operations (CSG/SDF), 3D math</li>
    <li><strong>Technical Documentation</strong> — authored internal studio documentation for team-wide systems</li>
    <li><strong>Shaders / Rendering</strong> — some exposure: outline/stencil shaders, basic material work and optimization</li>
    <li><strong>Python</strong> — 1–2 years, tooling, scripting & small apps</li>
    <li><strong>Java</strong> — 1 year of experience, database-oriented work</li>
    <li><strong>Brief Exposure</strong> — OpenGL, Bullet Physics, Kotlin, JavaScript (brief, occasional use)</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .profile-photo {
    width: 9rem;
    height: 9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
  }

  .about-intro h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  /* Stack on narrow screens, photo above text */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .profile-photo {
      width: 7rem;
      height: 7rem;
    }
  }
</style>